{"articleNo":"175419","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=175419&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[진주시] 2017 진주국제농식품박람회 자원봉사자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.07.07","hit":"2661","attachments":[{"name":"자원봉사 모집계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=175419&attachNo=77650"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 진주시</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">는 농업인들에게 새로운 비전을 제시하고 우리농업의 발전을 선도하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">2017 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">진주국제농식품박람회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">행사에 각종 농업기술 전시뿐 아니라 도시민 중심의 교육프로그램 개발 및 관람객에게 호응도 높은 선진국 형 체험박람회를 개최하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">2. 2017 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">진주국제농식품박람회의 성공적인 개최를 위하여 아래와 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">자원봉사자를 모집</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">하오니 많은 지원바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">모집분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일반분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">외국어 통역분야</span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">모집인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: 400</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">300, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">외국어 통역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">100)</span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: 2017. 7. 1 ~ 9. 15.</span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: “</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">” </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">계획서 참조</span></span></span></o:p></span></p><p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
